27:T562,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does AlUla to AMAALA take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Roughly 5 hours as a planning estimate, depending on the exact resort and stops. The driver confirms the timing for your day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you drop us at the airport rather than the resort?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. For an RSI flight we work the pickup back from your departure time and add a safety margin."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it worth driving rather than flying?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Driving is door to door with all luggage and a time you choose. Flying can be quicker for light travellers when a suitable flight exists; check current schedules and remember a car is still needed at each end."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we stop on the way?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — rest, prayer or photo stops. Tell us when you book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we add Shura Island afterwards?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Shura Island is another Red Sea destination near RSI; we can quote the onward leg."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I pay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cash to the driver or bank transfer, with an electronic receipt on request."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristTrip\",\"name\":\"AlUla to AMAALA Transfer\",\"description\":\"Private inter-destination transfer from AlUla to AMAALA on the Red Sea coast, for travellers continuing from heritage to the coast.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice\"},\"itinerary\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@type\